1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,445
And the six errors.

2
00:00:01,445 --> 00:00:05,429
If it will rain: no will in the if clause, if it rains.

3
00:00:05,429 --> 00:00:07,604
If I would have known: had known.

4
00:00:07,604 --> 00:00:08,867
If I was you: were.

5
00:00:08,867 --> 00:00:12,447
Unless you don't hurry: unless already contains not.

6
00:00:12,447 --> 00:00:15,351
In case it will be cold: in case it is cold.

7
00:00:15,351 --> 00:00:17,981
And if he would be here: if he were here.

